--- !u!114 &1761110470
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1761110468}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1f3ef889599182844a2f5643151998e9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  readingMechanicTutorial: {fileID: 0}
  storyText: {fileID: 561532364}
  fullText: "Ang Kwento ng Dalawang Anghel\n\nTwo heavenly angels traveled the world.
    During their journey, they were caught by nightfall and searched for a place
    to stay, and found a grand house.\n\n\u201CLet\u2019s go there! Let\u2019s ask
    if we can stay!\u201D said the younger angel.\n\nKnock\u2026 knock\u2026 knock\u2026\n\nThe
    door opened, and an old man appeared. His neck shimmered from the golden necklace
    he wore.\n\n\u201CWe were caught by night while traveling. May we stay here for
    the night\u2026\u201D said the older angel.\n\nThe old man didn\u2019t reply
    right away and stared at them. He hesitated because they were disguised and he
    didn\u2019t know they were angels. \n\nBut because they were polite, he let them
    in. He gave them a small, cramped room with a hard bed. \n\nHe didn\u2019t offer
    them any food, even though he knew they were shivering from hunger. \n\nAs they
    were about to sleep, the older angel noticed a hole in the wall. He fixed it
    and sealed the hole. The younger angel just watched him. \n\nThe next morning,
    they thanked the old man and left, and continued on their journey.\n\n\u201CI\u2019m
    really hungry!\u201D said the younger angel. \n\n\u201COkay, wait... over there
    is a small nipa hut... let\u2019s check and see if someone can help us...\u201D
    \n\nAs they approached the hut, they saw an elderly couple. It was clear from
    their posture that life was hard for them.\n\n\u201CGood afternoon, did you lose
    your way?\u201D asked the old man. \n\n\u201CWe were caught by nightfall, and
    we\u2019re hungry\u2026 It\u2019s embarrassing, but we\u2019d like to ask if
    you have a bit of bread to spare so we can get through the night,\u201D said
    the older angel. \n\n\u201CYes, we do. And it\u2019s too late for you to travel
    again, so please stay the night!\u201D said the old woman.\n\nEven though they
    were hungry, the younger angel noticed that the food they were given was the
    couple\u2019s only food. \n\nHe offered it back, but the couple insisted they
    eat since they had a long journey the next day. \n\nMoreover, the couple gave
    up their bed for the angels and slept on the floor.\n\nThe next morning, the
    younger angel woke to loud crying. He went outside and saw the old woman crying
    while her husband tended to their only cow, which had died. \n\nThe younger angel,
    now angry, went back inside and confronted the older angel.\n\n\u201CWhy did
    you do that? That rich old man didn\u2019t take care of us, but you fixed his
    wall. \n\nYet these kind old people gave us almost everything they had, and you
    let their cow die... Why!?\u201D \n\n\u201CI understand your anger, young angel\u2026
    But when we were at that selfish man\u2019s mansion, I saw treasure hidden behind
    a wall he seemed unaware of. Because of his wicked heart, I sealed it away.\u201D
    \n\n\u201CAs for the elderly couple\u2014last night, the angel of death came
    to take the old woman. But because they were kind to us\u2026 I gave him their
    cow instead.\u201D\n\nIn life, there are many stories like this. We often judge
    too quickly. But what we see may not be what we think it is. We are blessed in
    ways we don\u2019t always understand.\n\n\u2013 THE END \u2013"
  scrollbar: {fileID: 1500842307}
  lineSelector: {fileID: 1500842305}
